{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_05",
  "title": "Drowned in Fire",
  "storyCode": "EA-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9d0ada0332dfecbce6e2ba08ae27a3ed693a1fbfc29bb64c7c056a8bcb4a2741",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Was that another trick of the shadows? This isn't the right way. I'm going in circles."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't see the sky. How long has it been...? How far do I still have to go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, I'm in the Dark Woods, at least. The mist and noise Brigid was talking about didn't keep me out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tricky fae, shadows pointing the wrong way, fowlbeasts that trip you with branches... That's all more or less the same as when I was bringing Moran and the others back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The trees are too tall, and the leaves too thick. They block out the sky, making the life here different from outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...This is the right path. I'm at the heart of the Dark Woods now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The scenery seems different from before. Where did the red and gold of autumn go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why does it look like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The black mist?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So the woods are rejecting me after all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Loughshinny grabs her weapon tightly. If Nemos was right, and Dublinn never returned after leaving the city, then they were most likely swallowed by the mist.\nBut it shows no sign of aggression. It simply lingers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does it... reject me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, it's closer to indifference... disappointment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There is no answer except the rustling of leaves.\nLoughshinny shakes her head and cautiously goes around the mist, choosing a path that looks like it has a light at the end. The mist remains indifferent to her passage.\nThe fae that delight in leading travelers astray are nowhere to be seen."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Another dead end..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No time to waste here. I'm sorry, but I'll have to burn a way through—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're overthinking it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who's there?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take a guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... how could it be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're that gentleman from the city... I wanted to ask you something, but you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Indeed, hardly the most amicable of partings. Since then, I've been following and watching you for a while now. Consider it my way of reflecting on myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll admit you're not quite what I thought. But this is no time for small talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do not burn the trees. It should be enough to illuminate them with your fire. See for yourself what they really are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'What they really are'...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The leaves are razor sharp. The brambles are hard, and the branches have a metallic gleam... what is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's not important. What's important is that your fire can't burn through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now follow me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hurry, before the black mist changes its mind!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can talk later, but if that thing is in a bad mood, there won't be anything left to bury when it's done with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Isn't that a dead end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why do you put so much faith in what you see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just listen and move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is... the path I took when we came to Na Saoirsí!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So this is where those trails lead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you don't mind me asking, are you and the forest fae—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't be ridiculous. I have nothing to do with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The woods, though... Centuries have passed, but it's hardly changed at all, other than the black mist."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ruins the view, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll be out of the Dark Woods soon. Now could you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tsk, tsk, this is really..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Exiled King",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look behind you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Reed!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Reed! We're here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The refugees appear on the well-lit edge of the woods."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What happened in the city? It's like the black mist got angry the moment you entered it, cutting it off from the outside. It's been days since anyone went into the Dark Woods."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A few people were hunting on the outskirts when they heard sounds from within, and saw what looked like fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whenever something similar happened before, the wakemen told us not to approach the woods."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This time, though, we recognized your fire. We could hardly ignore it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You shouldn't have come. It's dangerous here—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then you shouldn't have either, not on your own. We all learned our lesson about letting you go off alone after waiting for you in the marshes outside Londinium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We trust you. So please, trust us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're welcome. Let's go back to camp."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mhm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sir, would you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who are you talking to? Is there someone else with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The red dragon turns around, but her uninvited companion has already vanished without a trace, like the dew under the morning sun."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you for providing refuge for these people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nemos entrusted them to us. We simply did our part."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "On behalf of the wakemen, I promise that we will not reveal your existence to anyone unaware. And you have seen with your own eyes that your people are safe. Now it is time for you to leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you mean? Is she not welcome here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Neither are your people, Moran."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whenever two red dragons meet, endless conflict awaits. If you insist on involving yourselves in it, then we can no longer offer you sanctuary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How could you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is how we have always been. The wakemen neither start nor end conflicts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The disputes of the living are not our concern. We watch over only the souls of the departed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you are truly the noble and compassionate leader Moran imagines you to be, you will not drag these innocents into your battle, red dragon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This isn't a battle between two red dragons. I came to seek your help on behalf of the people of Na Saoirsí—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Every battle has its reasons."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not an excuse. Reed wouldn't do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Excuse or not, the disputes of the living are none of our concern... A hard-learned lesson whose bitter fruits we continue to taste to this day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What if I'm here to ask you to hold a funeral?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A funeral?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In <i>that</i> case, the wakemen will welcome you. But for that, and only that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now tell me the name of the departed, their deeds in life, and... present the remains."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "His name was... Culann. He was a blacksmith."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Culann?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How did he die?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The purple flames of death took both his life and his will. Not even my flames can help him now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then why is it that not a single denizen of Na Saoirsí has come to us to request a funeral since the city became independent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So it transpires that the first Na Saoirsían to be mourned since the end of the war was not taken by war at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So I weave the straw into a ring like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes. Then adorn it with these flowers, and the wreath is complete."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I remember when the farmers put a wreath on your head, praying for a good harvest next year."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Mhm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Feels like old times. I miss that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you not happy here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I rather enjoy it myself, but the others might find it stifling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The life of a wakeman is almost like a self-punishment, after all. What's the word for it again? 'Asceticism'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No alcohol, no overeating, no fancy foods—can't even laugh too loud. They wake up before sunrise and sleep after midnight, and everything in between is some ritual or other."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At least they don't expect the same from us, but there's no avoiding them when we have to help out on the farms and stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've practically forgotten how to laugh—hah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Moran's the only one who goes out of her way to talk to them. She's learning something new every day. Might be how they tie certain knots, might be how to estimate the age of a tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Compared to the wakemen in the tales, though..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your Highness?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ma'am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I did not expect to find you here working with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taran Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Reed has always been like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Moran",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Should we excuse ourselves?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, I simply came to confirm the facts of the departed's life, for the purpose of the ritual."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Solemn Wakewoman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please, tell me. What happened to Culann?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will tell you all that I saw, as I saw it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loughshinny",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I hope it makes you feel something."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
